40
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:39,646
These include fostering a culture
of respect, creating equal

41
00:02:39,646 --> 00:02:44,160
opportunity to succeed and inviting and
integrating diverse perspectives.

42
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:48,394
To foster a culture of respect,
it's your job as a project manager to

43
00:02:48,394 --> 00:02:53,860
serve as a role model, set the tone for
the team and take action when needed.

44
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:56,979
That means modeling the values
of your organization,

45
00:02:56,979 --> 00:02:59,906
taking appropriate action
