46
00:02:59,906 --> 00:03:04,258
Creating an environment in which team
members feel comfortable speaking up

47
00:03:04,258 --> 00:03:08,067
with concerns, and
recognizing team contributions regularly.

48
00:03:08,067 --> 00:03:12,787
To create equal opportunity to succeed,
you should ensure that each person on

49
